duals  have been honored tonight  and i also um  would just like to thank of course  colette and lucy i want to thank our  amazing ep peter hirschman  at electronic arts everyone at  electronic arts and respawn  and oculus especially vince dusty and  laura  and our producers annie small and aaron  matthews thank you so much  to the guardians charlie phillips jess  gormley and lindsey poulton we  share we share this award with you  and um i just add something um  this award is a tribute and this film is  a tribute to women  everywhere in the world of any ages  that who are joining hands and fight  for justice with colette  vivla france thank you  you
 

